{"id":"vod_sn_38722","vodId":"38722","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"境界的彼方","name_cn":"境界的彼方","date":"2013-01-01","year":"2013","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/5d2c149f4e887325abae0948c84678d4.jpg"},"summary":"这个世界上存在着异形之物，其姿态千变万化，即为“妖梦”，以除去妖梦为业的，即为异界士。本作主人公神原秋人（KENN 配音），看起来是个普通的高二男生，实际上是由人类和妖梦结合而诞生的“半妖”。拥有不死之身的他，于某个黄昏，在校园天台遇见一名想要跳楼的少女栗山未来（种田梨纱 配音），出乎意料的是，少女居然对他发起了攻击。原来，看起来是个普通新生的眼镜美少女，竟是一名能够操纵血的异界士。　　拥有特殊能力的栗山未来，引起了异界士名门望族名濑家的注意。与秋人同为文艺部的名濑美月（茅原实里 配音）即是名濑家的次女，她嘱咐秋人远离栗山。肆虐的妖梦，孤独行走于世的异界士，以及罕有的半妖，在境界的彼方展开一个奇异的幻想故事。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:04:03","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Nt3Sg9822x1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TXeyTn6HD91/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VuYn5iGbNJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rYfy0HpL2D1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RFBU9dxLTf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TpPNBeKNcs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/mYhmb3KVAp1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fyw7qSDXzZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZFPubp0HkC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EBcvhfQszs1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UcVypRVTip1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/stMYYPSmhg1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:55.456Z"}